[recv] {"type": "message_start", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_41fr0emJ1parOSz97ycpMShS|fc_0a1369bb9cfb628e016a9a76a2092087d2847fcdf014c6ab1c", "toolName": "bash", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": " .../5.0.2/reachability-metadata.json               | 1063 ++++++++++++++++++++\n .../spring-cloud-vault-config/index.json           |   17 +\n .../5.0.2/execution-metrics.json                   |  108 ++\n .../spring-cloud-vault-config/5.0.2/stats.json     |   37 +\n .../spring-cloud-vault-config/5.0.2/.gitignore     |    4 +\n .../spring-cloud-vault-config/5.0.2/build.gradle   |   27 +\n .../5.0.2/gradle.properties                        |    6 +\n .../5.0.2/required-docker-images.txt               |    1 +\n .../5.0.2/settings.gradle                          |   20 +\n .../VaultConfigDataLoaderTest.java                 |  192 ++++\n .../native-image/reachability-metadata.json        |   80 ++\n .../5.0.2/user-code-filter.json                    |   13 +\n .../allowed-docker-images/Dockerfile-vault         |    1 +\n 13 files changed, 1569 insertions(+)\n\nChanged files:\nA\tmetadata/org.springframework.cloud/spring-cloud-vault-config/5.0.2/reachability-metadata.json\nA\tmetadata/org.springframework.cloud/spring-cloud-vault-config/index.json\nA\tstats/org.springframework.cloud/spring-cloud-vault-config/5.0.2/execution-metrics.json\nA\tstats/org.springframework.cloud/spring-cloud-vault-config/5.0.2/stats.json\nA\ttests/src/org.springframework.cloud/spring-cloud-vault-config/5.0.2/.gitignore\nA\ttests/src/org.springframework.cloud/spring-cloud-vault-config/5.0.2/build.gradle\nA\ttests/src/org.springframework.cloud/spring-cloud-vault-config/5.0.2/gradle.properties\nA\ttests/src/org.springframework.cloud/spring-cloud-vault-config/5.0.2/required-docker-images.txt\nA\ttests/src/org.springframework.cloud/spring-cloud-vault-config/5.0.2/settings.gradle\nA\ttests/src/org.springframework.cloud/spring-cloud-vault-config/5.0.2/src/test/java/org_springframework_cloud/spring_cloud_vault_config/VaultConfigDataLoaderTest.java\nA\ttests/src/org.springframework.cloud/spring-cloud-vault-config/5.0.2/src/test/resources/META-INF/native-image/reachability-metadata.json\nA\ttests/src/org.springframework.cloud/spring-cloud-vault-config/5.0.2/user-code-filter.json\nA\ttests/tck-build-logic/src/main/resources/allowed-docker-images/Dockerfile-vault\n\nRecent commits:\nbc068b8ef5 (HEAD -> ai/kimeta/add-lib-support-org.springframework.cloud-spring-cloud-vault-config-5.0.2-chunked-forge-9705-20260904074051298889-dcfd7b2148ae) Add support for org.springframework.cloud:spring-cloud-vault-config:5.0.2\neb20d5132c (ai/kimeta/human-intervention/issue-9705-library-new-request-org.springframework.cloud-spring-cloud-vault-config-5.0.2-a9438eac) Update generated library support for org.springframework.cloud:spring-cloud-vault-config:5.0.2\ndf0340ed93 Record exhausted Vault logger coverage\nfc876f1c56 Add automation logs for issue #9705\nc101c3ce67 Preserve failed automation work for issue #9705\ncb2e851074 Record exhausted dynamic-access class org.springframework.cloud.vault.config.VaultConfigDataLoader\ncca71728c6 Verify Vault lifecycle session token\n3808e963dc Bulk dynamic-access coverage (1/2)\n\nDocker scan references:\nstats/com.rabbitmq.client/amqp-client/0.8.0/execution-metrics.json:78:          \"target\": \"tests/tck-build-logic/src/main/resources/allowed-docker-images/Dockerfile-rabbitmq\"\nAGENTS.md:67:  - ./gradlew checkAllowedDockerImages --baseCommit=$(git rev-parse origin/master) --newCommit=$(git rev-parse HEAD)\nAGENTS.md:69:  - ./gradlew checkAllowedDockerImages\ntests/tck-build-logic/src/main/java/org/graalvm/internal/tck/GrypeTask.java:31: * Implements §AR-test-harness.6 — the {@code checkAllowedDockerImages} task that scans allowed\ntests/tck-build-logic/src/main/java/org/graalvm/internal/tck/GrypeTask.java:54:    private static final String DOCKERFILE_DIRECTORY = \"allowed-docker-images\";\ntests/tck-build-logic/src/main/java/org/graalvm/internal/tck/GrypeTask.java:141:        System.out.println(\"Generating info for docker image: \" + image);\ntests/tck-build-logic/src/main/java/org/graalvm/internal/tck/GrypeTask.java:209:                    \"This task should be executed only if there are changes in allowed-docker-images directory.\");\ntests/tck-build-logic/src/main/java/org/graalvm/internal/tck/GrypeTask.java:221:            throw new RuntimeException(\"Cannot find allowed-docker-images directory\");\ntests/tck-build-logic/src/main/java/org/graalvm/internal/tck/DockerUtils.java:20:    public static final String ALLOWED_DOCKER_IMAGES = \"/allowed-docker-images\";\ntests/tck-build-logic/src/main/java/org/graalvm/internal/tck/DockerUtils.java:25:            throw new RuntimeException(\"Cannot find allowed-docker-images directory\");\ntests/tck-build-logic/src/main/java/org/graalvm/internal/tck/DockerUtils.java:79:            throw new RuntimeException(\"Cannot find files in allowed-docker-images directory\");\ntests/tck-build-logic/src/main/groovy/org/graalvm/internal/tck/harness/tasks/ComputeAndPullAllowedDockerImagesTask.java:37: * 2) Validates them against the allowed-docker-images list\ntests/tck-build-logic/src/main/groovy/org/graalvm/internal/tck/harness/tasks/ComputeAndPullAllowedDockerImagesTask.java:192:                    If you need them, add Dockerfiles under tests/tck-build-logic/src/main/resources/allowed-docker-images \\\ntests/tck-build-logic/src/main/groovy/org.graalvm.internal.tck-harness.gradle:887:tasks.register(\"checkAllowedDockerImages\", GrypeTask.class) { task ->\ndocs/CONTRIBUTING.md:226:Only Docker images that are listed in the [`allowed-docker-images` directory](https://github.com/oracle/graalvm-reachability-metadata/blob/master/tests/tck-build-logic/src/main/resources/allowed-docker-images) can be used for testing.\ndocs/CONTRIBUTING.md:228:That pull request should add a new file in the [`allowed-docker-images` directory](https://github.com/oracle/gr